  "notes": "First draft against one real bill (City of Dublin, Spectrum Business Internet, invoice 133432501081425). The bill-to (managed client) occupies the top-left position a vendor's own letterhead normally would - Spectrum's own brand only appears mid-page ('Thank you for choosing Spectrum Business'), so vendor_name reads that line rather than top-left. Not yet checked against a second Spectrum bill from a different managed client - status stays draft until it is.",
